        <li><a href="https://cleantechnica.com/2026/09/29/op-ed-upcoming-philippine-electric-vehicle-summit-is-an-audit-of-national-policy/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Op-Ed: Upcoming Philippine Electric Vehicle Summit is an Audit of National Policy — CleanTechnica</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/enervenue-opens-factory-secures-first-multi-mwh-order-for-30000-cycle-nickel-hydrogen-batteries-at-chinese-oilfield/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">EnerVenue opens factory, secures first multi-MWh order for 30,000-cycle nickel-hydrogen batteries at Chinese oilfield — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Battery Technology Company Receives Approval for Sale of $100 Million of Exported Recycled Black Mass Critical Minerals with License from U.S. Department of Commerce – American Battery Technology Company - American Battery Technology Company — Google News - Battery Technology</a></li>
