        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPV3VmeG1GclJtQzlLc0JfLXFUamNNU09Zd2tMeEZiUmJRR1hfVGNVZFpjYVJtaEpDamJXSmFmWFhrMnhOSFdyMk80cWF2QXpIVlQxQmhDbi1rRzIyeVNteE4zbkF2UVhTX3dSMms4eHZkWHVmeDQydk9USldQLWZ5dlp1a216dnU0dWExSWl2TVgzYlp1dnd0UWJ3?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goldman Sachs Names Top China Battery Stocks - Yahoo Finance — Google News - Battery Technology</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPajdrRUMtN3hMUmo2REk3YUFKalRQLVpoY1RfdUlBcHlmVHpYOFl5N09SOXpsbmZEbXhDbTVsYWhGN25lTk5NcG1CRTlPQ1BQTFZzQU9CNGROQ1RNR3dHYkFNZ2FtbVVoTEw4ejVIalMxU1ZEMXhONnZlaXV6TkhoOUhqTWF5VW1IWVFpYjlDRGx2UGNmSkVpb1dIMkltNmg1VUI4aTk2OA?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Battery Technology Shares Rise 10% After Receiving Export Approval - Yahoo Finance — Google News - Battery Technology</a></li>
