        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNMHhsSjVPV29BcnZqM1dPYVdaWWp6SUFhY0M1UGxOdk5uOGFtOUZhZ1pYeE4tYUQ1cGNSSmhzT05pUEN0Y3l0TFA4TVYxd3NMU2hlOWY4QmJrMTlOR1I5U0JaTGlYTlA1aDVWT29VcjU2VHcxVWRxcHV2ZV9obXJiVnkzNUVfaTVCdHpBZmFZeHNTZ0hKVDRpaHdDNGlpY3Z1M1BoOE9wTU5MQTZ3ZmtXS2s3MVZaM1k?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">American Battery Technology stock surges on export approval - Investing.com — Google News - Battery Technology</a></li>
